on-arrival: {!
const relationshipContribution = Math.max(
    -12,
    Math.min(12, (Number(Q.president_relation) - 40) * 0.35)
);
Q.partnership_presidential_roll =
    Math.floor((this.random.uint32() / 4294967296) * 17) - 8;
Q.partnership_presidential_lobby_bonus = Q.partnership_palace_lobby ? 12 : 0;
// A Left President can fight the cabinet over credit or implementation, but
// will not randomly veto a limited equality bill already passed by the Sejm.
Q.partnership_presidential_alignment_bonus = Q.left_president ? 20 : 0;
Q.partnership_presidential_score = Math.round(
    48 +
    relationshipContribution +
    Q.partnership_presidential_lobby_bonus +
    Q.partnership_presidential_alignment_bonus +
    (Q.pres_2025_hostile_president ? -10 : 8) +
    Math.max(-3, Math.min(3, (Number(Q.psl_relation) - 40) * 0.10)) +
    Q.partnership_presidential_roll
);
Q.last_policy_stage = "Presidential decision";
Q.last_policy_authority = Q.president_name;
if (Q.partnership_presidential_score < 50) {
    Q.partnership_presidential_outcome = "Vetoed";
    Q.last_policy_implementation = "Blocked after parliamentary passage";
    Q.president_veto_count = (Number(Q.president_veto_count) || 0) + 1;
    Q.president_relation -= 5;
    Q.progressive_credibility -= 2;
Q.public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_salience += 16;
Q.public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_support += -9;
Q.public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_backlash += 9;
    Q.news_headline =
        Q.president_name + " vetoes the partnership law";
} else {
    Q.partnership_presidential_outcome = "Signed";
    Q.partnership_signature_backlash = Q.left_president ? 8 : 4;
    Q.partnership_signature_right_pressure = Q.left_president ? 4 : 2;
    Q.last_policy_implementation = "Enacted; implementation scheduled for the next monthly callback";
    Q.president_relation += 4;
    Q.minority_safety += 5;
    Q.partnership_implementation_pending = 1;
    Q.partnership_implementation_due_time = (Number(Q.time) || 0) + 1;
    Q.progressive_credibility += 2;
    Q.public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_salience += 8;
    Q.public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_backlash +=
        Q.partnership_signature_backlash;
    Q.far_right_agenda += Q.partnership_signature_right_pressure;
    Q.news_headline =
        Q.president_name + " signs the partnership law";
}
!}

= July 2026 — The presidential pen

[? if partnership_presidential_outcome = "Vetoed": **[+ president_name +]
vetoes the bill.** <span class="party-lewica"><b>Katarzyna Kotula</b></span> found a Sejm majority for a limited
legal status; the President has chosen to leave those couples without it.?]
[? if partnership_presidential_outcome = "Signed": **[+ president_name +]
signs the bill.** Parliamentary passage has become enacted law. Registries,
hospitals and courts must still turn Kotula's compromise into ordinary
practice.
[? if partnership_presidential_alignment_bonus > 0: The aligned Left presidency
added **[+ partnership_presidential_alignment_bonus +]** points toward assent.?]
**Backlash:** +[+ partnership_signature_backlash +] LGBT-equality backlash ·
+[+ partnership_signature_right_pressure +] far-right agenda pressure.?]

[? if partnership_palace_lobby: The earlier Palace protocol gave the President
a practical account of registration, hospital access and inheritance. It
made assent easier to defend without guaranteeing it.?]
[? if not partnership_palace_lobby: No dedicated implementation delegation
reached the Palace before the decision; the President judged the parliamentary
text and its politics alone.?] <span class="party-psl"><b>Władysław Kosiniak-Kamysz</b></span> now has to explain
whether PSL's compromise was a durable settlement or merely a vote on the road
to a veto.

- @partnership_campaign
- @partnership_narrow
- @partnership_administrative
- @partnership_signed_implement
- @partnership_signed_expand
- @partnership_signed_credit

@partnership_campaign
title: Make the veto a national equality campaign
subtitle: Put the couples denied protection beside every presidential defence of the veto.
view-if: partnership_presidential_outcome = "Vetoed"
on-arrival: progressive_credibility += 6; minority_safety += 2; president_relation -= 8; far_right_agenda += 5; media_capacity += 3; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_support += 12; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_salience += 12; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_left_ownership += 10; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_support += 9 if public_climate_progressive_index >= 48; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_support -= 7 if public_climate_progressive_index < 48; news_headline = "The veto becomes the coalition's clearest equality conflict"

Kotula opens the campaign with couples who cannot inherit a tenancy or obtain
information in a hospital. The Palace loses the comfort of debating an
abstraction; Lewica gains a clear conflict and no legal remedy. The far right
answers with its own national mobilisation, certain that the President has
shown where the line can be held.

- @poland_event_queue: Open the campaign

@partnership_narrow
title: Ask PSL and the Palace for an even narrower rights bill
subtitle: Seek named minimum rights and a dated return, knowing that another reduction may exhaust Lewica's own coalition.
view-if: partnership_presidential_outcome = "Vetoed"
on-arrival: partnership_strategy = "Post-veto minimum-rights bill"; partnership_revision_pending = 1; partnership_revision_due_time = time + 2; psl_relation += 5; president_relation += 3; progressives_dissent += 6; razem_dissent += 5; government_coalition_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "Another compromise receives a dated parliamentary return"

Kosiniak-Kamysz and the Palace agree to discuss hospital information,
inheritance and tenancy without creating a general partnership status. Lewica
extracts a committee date and a list of rights before returning to the table.
Razem and equality organisers ask why a majority should negotiate downward
after the President, not the Sejm, rejected the first bill.

- @poland_event_queue: Ask for the narrower bill

@partnership_administrative
title: Expand contracts, hospital access and inheritance guidance administratively
subtitle: Use a non-PiS cabinet's existing powers for fragments of protection, while admitting that guidance is not a civil status.
view-if: partnership_presidential_outcome = "Vetoed" and left_in_government = 1 and government_party != "pis"
on-arrival: government_delivery += 3; minority_safety += 3; constitutional_restraint -= 1; legal_dualism += 1; president_relation -= 3; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_support += 6; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_salience += -4; news_headline = "Administrative workarounds deliver fragments of a vetoed statute"

Ministries revise hospital guidance, standard contracts and administrative
forms wherever existing law allows. Some couples gain practical protection;
none gains the civil status the President vetoed, and courts need not accept
every instruction. The cabinet has softened the injury while opening another
argument over governing around a constitutional veto.

- @poland_event_queue: Revise the guidance

@partnership_signed_implement
title: Build a national implementation and legal-aid network
subtitle: Legal-aid preparation adds safety and trust; the enacted law's state delivery arrives through the next-month cabinet callback.
view-if: partnership_presidential_outcome = "Signed"
on-arrival: minority_safety += 3; public_trust += 2; local_network += 2; administrative_reform_pressure += 2; media_capacity += 2 if left_in_government = 0; news_headline = "A signed partnership law receives implementation scrutiny and legal support"

Lewica trains local legal-aid desks to follow the first registrations, hospital
disputes and inheritance cases. [? if left_in_government and
equality_minister_party = "Lewica": Equality Minister **[+ equality_minister
+]** receives the reports and carries them to the competent registry, health
and justice offices before their implementation orders are due.?][? if
left_in_government and equality_minister_party != "Lewica": The desks send
their reports to the serving Equality Ministry and the responsible offices.
Lewica can press those ministers in cabinet; it cannot turn Kotula's party role
into authority over their departments.?][? if not left_in_government: The
network cannot direct the cabinet, but it can expose every office that treats a
signed law as optional.?] A signature becomes something couples can test in a
real room, not a triumph left on the Sejm board.

- @poland_event_queue: Train the legal-aid desks

@partnership_signed_expand
title: Treat signature as the bridge to marriage equality
subtitle: Celebrate the protection, then ask Parliament why legal partnership should remain the ceiling.
view-if: partnership_presidential_outcome = "Signed"
on-arrival: progressive_credibility += 5; feminist_trust += 3; psl_relation -= 6; government_coalition_dissent += 4; far_right_agenda += 3; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_support += 10; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_left_ownership += 9; news_headline = "The presidential signature opens the next equality campaign"

Kotula thanks the majority that enacted the compromise and announces that the
next bill will concern equal marriage. PSL had expected a period of quiet and
calls the move a breach of political peace. Equality organisations finally see
the partial law described as protection worth using, not gratitude owed to the
parties that stopped short.

- @poland_event_queue: Announce the next bill

@partnership_signed_credit
title: Share credit with PSL and the President
subtitle: Shared ownership protects implementation, but equality organisers will notice how widely Lewica spreads the credit.
view-if: partnership_presidential_outcome = "Signed"
on-arrival: psl_relation += 4; president_relation += 4; public_trust += 2; progressives_dissent += 2; news_headline = "Coalition and Palace jointly defend an enacted compromise"

Kotula, Kosiniak-Kamysz and **[+ president_name +]** appear separately but use
the same language: a limited law, enacted by institutions that disagreed on
more. The shared ownership protects implementation from immediate partisan
reversal. It also blurs who spent years demanding the reform and who agreed
only after reducing it.

- @poland_event_queue: Agree the shared language

@braun_detention_2026
